# --- Claude Code -------------------------------------------------------------
# .claude/ is NOT tracked — the working set (skills, agents, hooks, settings.json)
# is handed to new developers by copy, not by clone.
# CLAUDE.md moved to the repo root and IS tracked since 2026-09-01.
# See document/getting-started/onboarding.md §4 for what to copy and what must
# never leave the machine (FromAI/, settings.local.json).
# NOTE: .gitignore has no inline comments — never append "# ..." after a pattern.
.claude/
.mcp.json

**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# workflow_settings.yaml is intentionally NOT listed here: it is already tracked,
# so the old ignore entry never took effect. Edits to it are committed and shared.

# --- SPK plugin ---------------------------------------------------------------
# ai_context/ is scaffolding created by the spk@inline Claude Code plugin.
# It duplicates document/project_wiki/, which is the authoritative LLM wiki here
# (and the only one the doc-sync hard rule and the Stop hook enforce).
# Decision 2026-08-26 (do not track it) was reversed 2026-09-01: the ignore rule
# below is commented out, so ai_context/ is no longer ignored via .gitignore.
# NOTE: on the machine where this was changed, /ai_context/ is still listed in
# .git/info/exclude (local-only, never committed), so the folder stays hidden
# there but shows up as untracked in every other clone.
# Deleting the folder is safe -- the plugin recreates it on the next session start.
# ai_context/
